# 1st Word Plus 2.02 with its Epson FX table printing SET128.TXT, every Atari
# character from 128 to 255 (tools/dev/st/make_set128.py): what a printer
# table sends for the characters above ASCII (international sets, substitutes).
# As print-wordplus-fx, with SET128.TXT in DOCS on the work copy of disk 1.
@printer
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/launchers/wordplus.st
@disk-b tools/dev/builds/disks/wordplus-set128.st
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 1500
mouse 30 30
click left 2
wait 25
mouse 411 169
click left 2
wait 100
mouse 72 4
mouse 114 23
click left 2
wait 150
mouse 234 96
click left 2
wait 100
key 0x01
type set128.txt
key 0x1c
wait 200
shot printopts
printwatch
mouse 352 169
click left 2
printer 100 6000
